Conlang Word Generator
----------------------

This is a very poorly documented word generator for constructed
languages.  It is meant to work with JSON files like the ones furnished
with this distribution.  Documentation will be forthcoming as time
allows.

Now partially aided and abetted by AI.  Parts of this program's codebase
are implemented and/or refined by OpenAI's _Codex_ tool.  In particular,
most of the tests are AI-generated.  I personally vet every line generated
by Codex before it is committed to the repository.
